# Semgrep ignore list for the security gate (.github/workflows/security-scan.yml).
# A .semgrepignore REPLACES semgrep's built-in defaults, so the defaults are
# restated first. Code directories stay scanned; only non-code and generated
# paths are excluded.

# --- semgrep built-in defaults (restated) ---
:include .gitignore
node_modules/
build/
dist/
vendor/
.env/
.venv/
.tox/
*.min.js
.npm/
.yarn/
test/
tests/
*_test.go
.semgrep
.semgrep_logs/

# --- generated / tooling output ---
coverage/
.stryker-tmp/
reports/
.claude/

# --- governance and prose archives (markdown, not code) ---
# .asif/NEXUS-archive-*.md tripped detect-insecure-websocket on a plain-text
# websocket URL in prose (run 37062617182).
.asif/
